        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>精酿、原浆、鲜啤、生啤、扎啤、干啤、冰啤的区别</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cfd8f7 0%, #dfe4fb 30%, #e8e2f6 60%, #d9d4f2 100%);\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 42px;\n    left: 26px;\n    width: 490px;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1c1c3c;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .card {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 165px;\n    left: 22px;\n    width: 496px;\n    height: 528px;\n    background: #fdfdfd;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(90,90,140,0.12);\n  }\n  /* generic node label with \"scribble\" look */\n  .node {\n    position: absolute;\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    padding: 5px 8px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .black {\n    background: #17171b;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 9px 14px;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .out {\n    background: #fdeaea;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 5px 10px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: #333;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 9px 11px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9b9d0;\n    color: #8a8aa5;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\">精酿、原浆、鲜啤、生啤、<br>扎啤、干啤、冰啤的区别</div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\"></div>\n\n  <!-- connector lines placeholder (branch curves) -->\n  <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"left:180px; top:180px; width:60px; height:220px; border:none; color:transparent;\">[Diagram: 分支曲线]</div>\n\n  <!-- Branch 1: 啤酒原浆 -->\n  <div class=\"node black\" style=\"left:66px; top:270px;\">啤酒原浆</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:230px; top:186px; background:#ef4136; width:158px;\">不杀菌+不滤清</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:410px; top:188px; background:#fde3e0;\">原浆啤酒</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:275px; top:231px; background:#f7941e; width:113px;\">不杀菌+滤清</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:418px; top:233px; background:#fdeedd;\">鲜啤</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:236px; top:276px; background:#f2d024; color:#3a3000; width:184px;\">不杀菌+滤清+膜过滤除菌(非高温)</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:448px; top:278px; background:#fbf6d7;\">生啤</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:255px; top:321px; background:#2eb872; width:165px;\">桶装鲜啤+二氧化碳+冰镇</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:448px; top:323px; background:#dff5e8;\">扎啤</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:230px; top:371px; background:#3b6fd4; width:190px;\">滤清+巴氏杀菌或瞬时高温杀菌</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:448px; top:373px; background:#e0e8fa;\">熟啤</div>\n\n  <!-- Branch 2: 啤酒 -->\n  <div class=\"node black\" style=\"left:83px; top:452px; font-size:19px; padding:10px 18px;\">啤酒</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:250px; top:432px; background:#ef4136; width:110px; font-size:13px;\">精酿啤酒</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:373px; top:434px; background:#fde3e0; font-size:12px;\">追求独特的口味</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:250px; top:487px; background:#f7941e; width:110px; font-size:13px;\">工业啤酒</div>\n  <div class=\"node out\" style=\"left:373px; top:489px; background:#fdeedd; font-size:12px;\">追求工业标准化</div>\n\n  <!-- Branch 3: 按工艺区分 -->\n  <div class=\"node black\" style=\"left:76px; top:592px;\">按工艺区分</div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:232px; top:558px; background:#ef4136; width:52px;\">冰啤</div>\n  <div class=\"desc\" style=\"left:298px; top:534px; width:190px; background:#fdeceb;\">\n    先把啤酒的温度降到冰点，使啤酒因低温而产生冷冻浊，然后再进行过滤使啤酒变清，和普通啤酒最大的不同之处在于降温的冰晶化处理，使酒色更亮丽，口感更清爽醇厚，酒精度数也有一定提高。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"node\" style=\"left:232px; top:642px; background:#f7941e; width:52px;\">干啤</div>\n  <div class=\"desc\" style=\"left:298px; top:620px; width:190px; background:#fdf2e6;\">\n    干啤采用了特殊的酵母进行发酵酿制，使啤酒中所含的糖分完全转化为酒精，比普通啤酒要低，让干啤喝起来的口感干爽而不甜，清爽而无余味。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
